{"4298800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FORJ", "steam_appid": 4298800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4948350], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The arena takes everything. The forge gives it back, sharper.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FORJ is a co-op action roguelite that fuses white-knuckle arena runs with a living crafting hub you build, staff and automate. Descend into cursed arenas, survive long enough to extract, then haul your spoils back home, where every weapon can be reforged into something monstrous, and your hand-built golems never stop working.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot drops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/b7003878ac6936eea2ea44f265321d47.poster.avif?t=1784739767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/b7003878ac6936eea2ea44f265321d47.webm?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/b7003878ac6936eea2ea44f265321d47.mp4?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy you drop can leave behind a weapon, a set piece, a legendary with a rule-bending passive, or a stat stone waiting to be socketed. Over 100 pieces of gear and 36 weapons across 9 archetypes, spread across 7 rarities up to Timeless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick it up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/2146391294835a563ed967d124ffac1c.poster.avif?t=1784739767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/2146391294835a563ed967d124ffac1c.webm?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/2146391294835a563ed967d124ffac1c.mp4?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every drop rolls with a visible quality tier, from a perfect T1 to a shameful T9. Grab it, check the tooltip, decide on the spot: equip it, sell it, or feed it to the forge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reforge it</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/567def4e4f78122a0a7000ead57a5104.poster.avif?t=1784739767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/567def4e4f78122a0a7000ead57a5104.webm?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/567def4e4f78122a0a7000ead57a5104.mp4?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push gear from +0 to +9, imbue weapons with elemental effects, enchant them with dozens of affixes, socket stat stones, and when you're feeling brave, let the Hourglass of Ages twist an item's fate before freezing it forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face a boss</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/766ca47d011c0ac910a154c09ec23ce1.poster.avif?t=1784739767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/766ca47d011c0ac910a154c09ec23ce1.webm?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/766ca47d011c0ac910a154c09ec23ce1.mp4?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-phase bosses rule floors 5 and 10 of every biome, each phase adding new attacks, telegraphs and fury. Detonate elemental status combos like Overload and Superconduct to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extract</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/7575065b548d32ff8559b83884dbfd42.poster.avif?t=1784739767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/7575065b548d32ff8559b83884dbfd42.webm?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/7575065b548d32ff8559b83884dbfd42.mp4?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the onslaught, bring down the boss, then sprint for the exit door as the horde scales out of control behind you. Extraction floors don't let you leave quietly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build golems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/2961bc5b1006fe0b2cb941ad0229faca.poster.avif?t=1784739767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/2961bc5b1006fe0b2cb941ad0229faca.webm?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/2961bc5b1006fe0b2cb941ad0229faca.mp4?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble golems piece by piece, head, arms, body, legs, and put them to work: mining, woodcutting, crafting, forging, selling. They keep producing while you're deep in the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your hub</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/ecda4754b05d00f4aaea114c444da186.poster.avif?t=1784739767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/ecda4754b05d00f4aaea114c444da186.webm?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/ecda4754b05d00f4aaea114c444da186.mp4?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place mines, crafting stations and workshops, decorate your grounds, and wear your own walking paths into the dirt. A base that grows the way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/6a9cf9c1e08264cd3bbe8bf27f83533d.poster.avif?t=1784739767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/6a9cf9c1e08264cd3bbe8bf27f83533d.webm?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/6a9cf9c1e08264cd3bbe8bf27f83533d.mp4?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op through Steam. Invite your friends, share the run and the loot. No one dies alone, fight your way to a downed ally and pull them back to their feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell it all</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/25de0f90cef2d3617e06981ace7484b5.poster.avif?t=1784739767\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/25de0f90cef2d3617e06981ace7484b5.webm?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/25de0f90cef2d3617e06981ace7484b5.mp4?t=1784739767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock your display tables and watch customers walk in, browse and pay real gold. Fill contracts, dodge the black market dealer's prices, and keep the forge economy running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The arena never runs out of floors. The forge never runs out of work. How deep will you go?</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The arena takes everything. The forge gives it back, sharper.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FORJ is a co-op action roguelite that fuses white-knuckle arena runs with a living crafting hub you build, staff and automate. Descend into cursed arenas, survive long enough to extract, then haul your spoils back home, where every weapon can be reforged into something monstrous, and your hand-built golems never stop working.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot drops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298800/extras/b7003878ac6936eea2ea44f265321d47.poster.avif?t=178473